1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,733
Night three in the tower. Kai goes up
to the roof with the radio, and he
stays there a long time.

2
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:12,933
Come up here. Somebody is signaling. A
lamp. In the warehouse district. Three
short. Three long. Three short.

3
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:20,533
A warehouse with no lights, a lamp in
one window, and a dust cloud hanging
over it. Dust. I look at my sleeve.
Seven puffs.
